{'symbol': 'TSCO', 'date': '2022-12-07 15:30:00', 'title': "NEWSWEEK NAMES TRACTOR SUPPLY TO LIST OF “AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES”", 'text': "BRENTWOOD, TENN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TRACTOR SUPPLY COMPANY (NASDAQ: TSCO), THE LARGEST RURAL LIFESTYLE RETAILER IN THE UNITED STATES, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED ON NEWSWEEK'S 2023 LIST OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES. THE LIST, NOW IN ITS FOURTH YEAR OF PUBLICATION, HIGHLIGHTS COMPANIES THAT “STEP UP” WHEN IT COMES TO BEING AN EXCELLENT CORPORATE CITIZEN. TRACTOR SUPPLY WAS ALSO FEATURED AS ONE OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES IN 2022."}